{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《二維碼產生器》是一款集 QR 碼生成與掃描於一身的工具，適合餐廳印碼、開發者測試連結、名片交換及日常 QR 碼需求。支援自訂顏色、加入 Logo，生成後即可分享或匯出，無需註冊，完全離線可用。目前原價 US $1.99，正在限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>二維碼生成與掃描</h2>\n<p>只需幾秒就能生成任意 QR 碼，涵蓋網址、文字、WiFi、名片、電話、電郵、簡訊及應用程式連結；亦可製作 EAN-13、Code128 等主流條碼。自訂顏色、邊框與 Logo 後可直接分享或匯出 PNG。開啟相機掃描 QR 碼或條碼即時取得結果，所有記錄離線儲存於本機，保護私隱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-603-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-604-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-605-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-606-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-607-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：二維碼產生器-掃碼識別條碼製作與分享WiFi密碼本</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T10:04:34.180764+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}